{"pages":[{"w":720,"h":1080,"ocr":false,"segs":[["THE HERO WINS",53.650400000000005,352.10399999999993,339.40139999999997,408.08499999999992,37,false],["IN THE END",53.650400000000005,382.11099999999988,257.15039999999999,438.09199999999987,37,false],["BUT HE",68.650400000000005,425.94200000000001,286.19919999999996,528.53399999999999,64,false],["DIES IN THE",68.650400000000005,475.92600000000004,412.4455999999999,578.51800000000003,64,false],["MIDDLE",112.42640000000002,525.90999999999997,338.21839999999997,628.50199999999995,64,false],["We experience life as a story, because",51.650300000000001,625.05780000000004,222.50465000000003,639.46730000000002,11.5,false],["life is a story and that story goes some-",51.650300000000001,636.55780000000004,229.52080000000001,650.96730000000002,11.5,false],["thing like this . . .",51.650300000000001,648.05780000000004,125.89315000000001,662.46730000000002,11.5,false],["BETRAYAL- We were created for a",51.650300000000001,670.81629999999996,216.34064999999998,685.7663,11.5,false],["relationship with God. But our hearts",51.650300000000001,682.55780000000004,219.8723,696.96730000000002,11.5,false],["turned proud, and pride corrupted. We",51.650300000000001,694.05780000000004,229.44029999999998,708.46730000000002,11.5,false],["abandoned God and intimacy turned",51.650300000000001,705.55780000000004,218.25080000000003,719.96730000000002,11.5,false],["to alienation. Humanity is now fallen.",51.650300000000001,717.05780000000004,217.97480000000002,731.46730000000002,11.5,false],["None of us lives or loves as we ought.",51.650300000000001,728.55780000000004,224.04565000000002,742.96730000000002,11.5,false],["ANTICIPATION- Though we be-",51.650300000000001,751.31629999999996,205.35815000000002,766.2663,11.5,false],["trayed God, He did not abandon us.",51.650300000000001,763.05780000000004,212.59280000000001,777.46730000000002,11.5,false],["Through the prophets God promised",51.650300000000001,774.55780000000004,220.01030000000003,788.96730000000002,11.5,false],["to send a Savior (the Messiah) who",51.650300000000001,786.05780000000004,210.94830000000002,800.46730000000002,11.5,false],["would restore and rescue us from the",51.650300000000001,797.55780000000004,222.82780000000002,811.96730000000002,11.5,false],["consequences of our sin and betrayal.",51.650300000000001,809.05780000000004,223.11529999999999,823.46730000000002,11.5,false],["PURSUIT- As promised, God sent the",51.650300000000001,831.81629999999996,227.35880000000003,846.7663,11.5,false],["one who would rescue and restore us.",51.650300000000001,843.55779999999993,224.4033,857.96730000000002,11.5,false],["His name was Jesus. The unique Son of",51.650300000000001,855.05779999999993,229.44030000000004,869.46730000000002,11.5,false],["God became one of us. He spoke truth,",51.650300000000001,866.55779999999993,229.39430000000004,880.96730000000002,11.5,false],["modeled love, granted forgiveness, and",51.650300000000001,878.05779999999993,228.8768,892.46730000000002,11.5,false],["offered life in all of its fullness.",51.650300000000001,889.55779999999993,189.15465,903.96730000000002,11.5,false],["SACRIFICE- Life’s greatest mystery",51.650300000000001,912.31629999999996,217.34230000000002,927.2663,11.5,false],["was revealed in love’s greatest act. Je-",51.650300000000001,924.05779999999993,222.95200000000006,938.46730000000002,11.5,false],["sus, the author of life, died for us: tak-",51.650300000000001,935.55779999999993,223.05779999999999,949.96730000000002,11.5,false],["ing upon himself our guilt and atoning",51.650299999999987,947.05779999999993,224.1618,961.46729999999991,11.5,false],["for our sin. How can we be sure? God",51.650299999999987,958.55779999999993,221.37764999999999,972.96729999999991,11.5,false],["raised Jesus from the dead. He is alive",51.650299999999987,970.05779999999993,223.79264999999998,984.46729999999991,11.5,false],["today and offers life to all who would",51.650299999999987,981.55779999999993,219.89529999999996,995.96729999999991,11.5,false],["receive it.",51.650299999999987,993.05779999999993,95.154799999999994,1007.4672999999999,11.5,false],["THE GIFT- Now God invites us to",244.83290000000002,716.96669999999995,402.31389999999999,731.91669999999999,11.5,false],["come back to him through trusting in",244.83290000000002,728.70820000000003,414.54875000000004,743.11770000000001,11.5,false],["Jesus. Forgiveness is a free and un-",244.83290000000002,740.20820000000003,403.08440000000002,754.61770000000001,11.5,false],["deserved gift, received only through",244.83290000000002,751.70820000000003,408.31575000000004,766.11770000000001,11.5,false],["genuine faith in Jesus Christ.",244.83290000000002,763.20820000000003,374.29989999999998,777.61770000000001,11.5,false],["My Father’s will is that everyone who",244.83290000000002,786.31169999999997,411.62889999999999,800.56020000000001,11.5,false],["looks to the son and believes in him",244.83290000000002,797.81169999999997,406.49875000000009,812.06020000000001,11.5,false],["shall have eternal life, and I will raise",244.83290000000002,809.31169999999997,407.15539999999999,823.56020000000001,11.5,false],["him up at the last day (John 6:40).",244.83290000000002,820.70820000000003,400.57740000000001,835.11770000000001,11.5,false],["This is the story—our story—from",244.83290000000002,843.70820000000003,402.47375,858.11770000000001,11.5,false],["rebellion to reunion: our journey back",244.83290000000002,855.20820000000003,416.57274999999998,869.61770000000001,11.5,false],["to intimacy with God.",244.83290000000002,866.70820000000003,341.91590000000002,881.11770000000001,11.5,false],["A TURNING POINT? All good stories",244.83290000000002,889.46669999999995,418.55189999999999,904.41669999999999,11.5,false],["have turning points and this could",244.83290000000002,901.20820000000003,399.09389999999996,915.61770000000001,11.5,false],["be the turning point of your story. If",244.83290000000002,912.70820000000003,408.0754,927.11770000000001,11.5,false],["you desire to turn to God and receive",244.83290000000002,924.20820000000003,415.12490000000003,938.61770000000001,11.5,false],["Christ, you can express that right now",244.83290000000002,935.70820000000003,416.32090000000005,950.11770000000001,11.5,false],["to God, silently, in prayer.",244.83290000000002,947.20820000000003,358.65989999999999,961.61770000000001,11.5,false],["If you’d like to find out more, just go to",244.83290000000002,970.20820000000003,421.0014000000001,984.61770000000001,11.5,false],["EveryStudent.com where millions of",244.83290000000002,981.70820000000003,408.82290000000006,996.11770000000001,11.5,false],["students have gone to explore faith.",244.83290000000002,993.20820000000003,407.28190000000006,1007.6177,11.5,false],["EVERYSTUDENT.COM",244,1013.304,435.24459999999999,1042.1579999999999,18,false]]}]}